1
00:00:00,633 --> 00:00:02,857
Your customer may not wait until morning.

2
00:00:03,488 --> 00:00:08,443
They have found the right car.
But one question remains.

3
00:00:09,079 --> 00:00:11,036
Can we talk about the price?

4
00:00:12,532 --> 00:00:17,395
Kopilotti Sales brings price negotiation
into the dealership's digital sales journey.

5
00:00:18,024 --> 00:00:21,034
The buyer reviews the vehicle
and its condition information.

6
00:00:21,671 --> 00:00:24,959
From the vehicle listing,
they can move on to making an offer.

7
00:00:26,467 --> 00:00:32,930
AI supports the conversation.
Dealer-defined rules determine the commercial outcome.

8
00:00:33,566 --> 00:00:38,266
Internal price limits are not shared
with the language model or the buyer's browser.

9
00:00:38,905 --> 00:00:41,163
Commercial authority stays with the dealer.

10
00:00:42,632 --> 00:00:47,390
An offer may be accepted, countered,
or declined.

11
00:00:48,023 --> 00:00:51,601
When a case needs judgment,
it is escalated for human review.

12
00:00:52,236 --> 00:00:55,119
Uncertainty is not resolved by guessing.

13
00:00:56,600 --> 00:01:00,235
Development now also covers
state management after acceptance.

14
00:01:00,867 --> 00:01:07,130
In the new, tested implementation, the agreed price,
reservation and deal state are recorded together.

15
00:01:07,765 --> 00:01:10,972
If a write fails,
the operation is rolled back as a whole.

16
00:01:12,467 --> 00:01:16,195
The tested flow prevents
conflicting reservations for the same vehicle.

17
00:01:16,826 --> 00:01:20,196
Repeating the same request
does not create another deal.

18
00:01:20,831 --> 00:01:24,652
This new flow is not yet connected
to the public demo.

19
00:01:26,163 --> 00:01:30,643
The agreed price and offer history
can be collected for the dealership to review.

20
00:01:31,279 --> 00:01:34,544
A dealership-scoped summary API
has been implemented.

21
00:01:35,178 --> 00:01:40,052
Its staff interface and automatic contact handoff
are still under development.

22
00:01:41,566 --> 00:01:45,525
An agreed price does not mean
the car has been paid for or handed over.

23
00:01:46,157 --> 00:01:50,336
The dealership handles the contract,
payment confirmation and vehicle handover.

24
00:01:51,004 --> 00:01:55,033
Kopilotti does not handle customer funds
or make financing decisions.

25
00:01:56,532 --> 00:02:03,119
Trade-in valuation and vehicle-history handling
have also been developed and tested separately.

26
00:02:03,748 --> 00:02:09,004
Live connections to external valuation
and history providers are not yet in place.

27
00:02:09,643 --> 00:02:13,001
They require separately agreed integrations.

28
00:02:14,496 --> 00:02:18,352
The next step is a limited pilot
within a dealership's own sales journey.

29
00:02:18,986 --> 00:02:22,992
Select the vehicles, agree the boundaries
and measure the results.

30
00:02:23,628 --> 00:02:28,815
Kopilotti Sales. One link.
Keep the sales conversation moving.

31
00:02:29,450 --> 00:02:31,083
Let's talk about a pilot.
